## How to run

**Run it real** (prerequisites, else the gateway boots the fake and `/health` says why):
`uv sync --extra catalog && make db-up && make seed`, then `PICKY_REAL_ARMS=catalog make demo`. Note `make setup`
(`uv sync --locked`) removes extras, so re-run `uv sync --extra catalog` after it. `create()` refuses to build without
sqlalchemy; `search` / `get_offers` / `apply_scan` are still TODO in `service.py`, so the real trip fails until they land
(`make demo ARGS=--allow-errors` shows how far it gets).

```bash
uv run pytest arms/catalog                                   # base deps only
uv run python -m utils.data                                  # validate data/
uv run python -m arms.catalog.seed --out build/seed.sql      # inspect the SQL
docker run -d --name picky-db -e POSTGRES_USER=picky -e POSTGRES_PASSWORD=picky -e POSTGRES_DB=picky \
  -p 5432:5432 pgvector/pgvector:pg17
uv sync --extra catalog && make seed                         # = uv run --extra catalog python -m arms.catalog.seed --schema --apply
PICKY_REAL_ARMS=catalog make demo                            # real catalog in the pipeline
```

Fake: `create_fake(Services())` (gateway default). Pass `data_root=` / `today=` for deterministic tests.

